// Source: Locally authored (generic Power Platform App Insights queries)
// Daily request volume for the last 30 days, broken out by HTTP result code (200, 401, 403, 429, 500, 503, ...).
// Useful for spotting a spike of 429 throttling or 5xx outages.
requests
| where timestamp > ago(30d)
| summarize Calls = count() by bin(timestamp, 1d), resultCode
| render timechart
